        <item>
            <title>1.11.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:50:54 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>499</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Closing the last window of a workspace now takes you back to a workspace that still has windows.
- Closing the last window while Overview is open now closes Overview.
- Dragging the last window of a workspace onto another workspace in Overview now takes you there.
]]></description>
